{{page>meta:infobox:construction&noheader&nofooter&noeditbtn}}

Entry level dual band wireless router sold in as N600 (Linksys E2500v4), AC750 (Linksys E5300), AC1000 (Linksys E5350) and AC1200 (Linksys E5400).
Devices E2500v4, E5300 and E5350 are limited by software to lower speeds.
FCC agreement covers the four devices https://fccid.link/Q87/-03418

It has 1 WAN 100 Mbps port and 4 LAN 100 Mbps ports with status LEDs and two non-detachable external antennas.

{{media:linksys:e2500v4_front.jpeg?200|Front view of the Linksys E2500 V4 router}}

:!: Linksys E2500v4 uses a different CPU than v1-3 and it is //not// compatible with their firmware. Conversely, v4 firmware will //not// work on previous versions.

